{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13455","headline":"寻东溪还湖中作 · 刘眘虚","name":"寻东溪还湖中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出山更回首，日暮清溪深。\n东岭新别处，数猨叫空林。\n昔游有初迹，此路还独寻。\n幽兴方在往，归怀复爲今。\n云峰劳前意，湖水成远心。\n望望已超越，坐鸣舟中琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}